        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBN2008 Nobe Series Towel Ring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Nobe Series Towel Ring features concealed screw mounting for a sleek contemporary look. The modern styling means it will look good in even the most fashionable homes. It is large enough for the thickest full-sized towels but not so bulky that hand towels would look out of place hanging from it. It is available in satin nickel and polished chrome finishes. This bathroom towel ring is made with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2008-specifications.gif?v=1704354729\" width=\"208\" height=\"367\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBN2008 Towel Ring Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBN Nobe Series\"><b>Deltana Nobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Nobe Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Ring:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2008.pdf?v=1691095339\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBN2008 Towel Ring Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel ring, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
